{"seq":3,"slug":"group-ops-metrics-analytics","title":"拼团运营度量：成团率、履约时效与团长/选品效果分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/crossborder-group-fulfillment-ops/group-ops-metrics-analytics","wordCount":2832,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"拼团运营度量-成团率-履约时效与团长-选品效果分析\">拼团运营度量：成团率、履约时效与团长/选品效果分析</h1><p>拼团业务的运营报表最常犯的错误是<strong>只报&quot;成团了多少团&quot;，不报&quot;多少团有机会成&quot;</strong>。一次成团是&quot;发起 → 拉人 → 支付 → 达阈&quot;四段漏斗的联合结果，把分子分母拆错一个，成团率就能从 38% 变成 82%，而真实的用户流失点被彻底掩盖。跨境再叠一层：清关与干线让&quot;成团到签收&quot;的时长方差比国内大一个量级，同一套国内口径直接搬到跨境会得出&quot;履约一直在恶化&quot;的假警报。本文定义一套可落库、可对账、可拆因的度量体系，覆盖成团率、分段履约时效、团长效果与选品效果四个面，并给出跨境场景的口径修正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四层度量与北极星\">核心概念：四层度量与北极星</h2><p>拼团度量必须分层，因为每层的主语不同、可干预的人也不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>主语</th>\n<th>典型指标</th>\n<th>谁能改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件层</td>\n<td>用户行为</td>\n<td>发起、分享、访问、支付、退款</td>\n<td>增长/前端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团层</td>\n<td>团（聚合根）</td>\n<td>成团率、成团时长、失败归因</td>\n<td>成团引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链路层</td>\n<td>订单履约</td>\n<td>分段时效、清关滞留、签收时长</td>\n<td>履约/关务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策层</td>\n<td>团长 / 团品</td>\n<td>团长 ROI、团品四象限</td>\n<td>运营/选品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>北极星建议取&quot;有效成团率×有效履约率&quot;的复合值，而非单纯 GMV。</strong> GMV 会被刷单、补贴与超卖放大，而&quot;有效&quot;意味着已扣退款、已扣风控拦截、已过退货窗口。团的建模本身见<a href=\"../group-buying-model-group-as-order/group-as-order-aggregate-model\">团即订单：拼团交易模型与聚合边界</a>，本文只在其之上定义度量。</p>\n<p>分母纪律是整套体系的地基：<strong>成团率的分母是&quot;有效发起团数&quot;，不是&quot;展示的团数&quot;，也不是&quot;被访问的团数&quot;。</strong> 有效发起必须满足最小可成团条件（人数下限&gt;1、团长身份有效、库存预占成功）。把触达即计入分母，等于把系统门槛的失败转嫁给&quot;用户不努力&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成团率与失败归因\">成团率与失败归因</h2><p>成团率有两种口径，二者用途不同：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>成团率</mtext><mtext>发起</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>state</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>SUCCESS</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>有效发起</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>成团率</mtext><mtext>曝光</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>SUCCESS</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>进入成团页且停留</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{成团率}_{\\text{发起}} = \\frac{\\#\\{\\,g : \\text{state}(g) = \\text{SUCCESS}\\,\\}}{\\#\\{\\,g : \\text{有效发起}\\,\\}}, \\qquad\n\\text{成团率}_{\\text{曝光}} = \\frac{\\#\\{\\,g : \\text{SUCCESS}\\,\\}}{\\#\\{\\,g : \\text{进入成团页且停留} \\ge \\tau\\,\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成团率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">发起</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效发起</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">state</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SUCCESS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成团率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">曝光</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进入成团页且停留</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SUCCESS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>前者衡量成团引擎与选品的真实质量，是运营主看板口径；后者衡量页面转化，是产品口径。两者混用是&quot;数据打架&quot;的头号来源。<strong>成团时长</strong>（发起 → 达阈）应报中位数与 P90，因为均值会被长尾的&quot;僵尸团&quot;拖偏。</p>\n<p>失败归因要把&quot;没成团&quot;拆成互斥且穷尽的桶，否则永远无法定位改进点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[发起团] --&gt; T{库存预占成功?}&#10;  T --&gt;|否| I[INVENTORY_FAIL&lt;br/&gt;超卖/锁失败]&#10;  T --&gt;|是| U{拉人达下限?}&#10;  U --&gt;|否| L[UNDERFILLED&lt;br/&gt;人数不足]&#10;  U --&gt;|是| P{全员支付?}&#10;  P --&gt;|否| PAY[PAYMENT_TIMEOUT&lt;br/&gt;支付超时]&#10;  P --&gt;|是| W{团有效期前达阈?}&#10;  W --&gt;|否| EXP[EXPIRED&lt;br/&gt;超时未达阈]&#10;  W --&gt;|是| OK[SUCCESS&lt;br/&gt;成团]&#10;  L --&gt; M[可合并/补差&lt;br/&gt;见合并结算]&#10;  EXP --&gt; REF[自动退款]\">graph TD\n  S[发起团] --&gt; T{库存预占成功?}\n  T --&gt;|否| I[INVENTORY_FAIL&lt;br/&gt;超卖/锁失败]\n  T --&gt;|是| U{拉人达下限?}\n  U --&gt;|否| L[UNDERFILLED&lt;br/&gt;人数不足]\n  U --&gt;|是| P{全员支付?}\n  P --&gt;|否| PAY[PAYMENT_TIMEOUT&lt;br/&gt;支付超时]\n  P --&gt;|是| W{团有效期前达阈?}\n  W --&gt;|否| EXP[EXPIRED&lt;br/&gt;超时未达阈]\n  W --&gt;|是| OK[SUCCESS&lt;br/&gt;成团]\n  L --&gt; M[可合并/补差&lt;br/&gt;见合并结算]\n  EXP --&gt; REF[自动退款]</pre><p><code>UNDERFILLED</code> 与 <code>EXPIRED</code> 占比高指向选品或团长拉动力不足；<code>PAYMENT_TIMEOUT</code> 高指向支付链路或库存锁定时长；<code>INVENTORY_FAIL</code> 高是工程问题。未成团团的善后逻辑（合并、补差、退款）本身是一条独立链路，其结算口径会影响&quot;有效成团&quot;的最终定义，详见<a href=\"../group-formation-engine-inventory-pricing/underfilled-group-merge-settlement\">未成团合并、补差与结算</a>。存活者偏差在此处尤其危险：<strong>只统计&quot;成功的团&quot;的成团时长，会系统性低估真实等待体验</strong>，必须把失败团的存续时长也纳入分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"履约时效-跨境分段-sla\">履约时效：跨境分段 SLA</h2><p>跨境拼团的履约不是一段，而是<strong>七段串联</strong>，每段责任方不同、失败模式不同。只报端到端时长（order-to-deliver）无法定位卡点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>段</th>\n<th>起点 → 终点</th>\n<th>典型瓶颈</th>\n<th>归属</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S1 成团→支付</td>\n<td>达阈 → 全员付款完成</td>\n<td>支付超时、库存锁定过期</td>\n<td>交易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S2 支付→采购/集货</td>\n<td>付款 → 仓库收货上架</td>\n<td>团长自提点、预售缺货</td>\n<td>供应链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3 集货→出口申报</td>\n<td>上架 → 出口放行</td>\n<td>报关资料、9610 清单</td>\n<td>关务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S4 干线</td>\n<td>出口放行 → 目的国到港</td>\n<td>舱位、航班、港口拥堵</td>\n<td>物流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S5 进口清关</td>\n<td>到港 → 进口放行</td>\n<td>查验、税号、低值豁免判定</td>\n<td>关务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S6 尾程派送</td>\n<td>放行 → 首派</td>\n<td>派送网络覆盖</td>\n<td>物流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S7 签收</td>\n<td>首派 → 妥投</td>\n<td>二次派送、拒收</td>\n<td>物流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>端到端履约时长是各段之和，全部乘上渠道通过率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>OTD</mtext><mtext>中位</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><mtext>median</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>SLA</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>履约成功率</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OTD}_{\\text{中位}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{7} \\text{median}\\big(\\text{SLA}_i\\big), \\qquad\n\\text{履约成功率} = \\prod_{i=1}^{7} \\big(1 - f_i\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OTD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">中位</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLA</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">履约成功率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 段的失败/退回率。<strong>乘积结构意味着单段 2% 的失败会累积成显著的端到端损耗</strong>——七段各 2% 的失败，联合成功率已跌到约 87%。因此跨境看板必须按段上报，而不是只报一个 OTD 数字。</p>\n<p>跨境的时效方差主要来自 S5。清关滞留取决于申报模式与豁免资格：中国出口侧的 <code>9610</code>（跨境电商零售出口）、<code>9710</code>（B2B 直接出口）、<code>9810</code>（出口海外仓）三种监管方式代码对应不同的申报与退税路径（海关总署 2020 年第 75 号公告）。目的国侧，美国 <code>19 U.S.C. §321</code> 的 800 美元低值免税（de minimis）在 2025 年经行政令暂停适用，低值包裹转为全额征税，直接改变了 S5 的时效与成本结构；欧盟的低值关税豁免（150 欧元）在海关改革中被提上取消日程，同时 <code>IOSS</code>（进口一站式服务）要求 ≤150 欧元订单在销售点代收 VAT，欧盟 GPSR（Regulation (EU) 2023/988，2024-12-13 适用）还要求指定欧盟境内责任人。<strong>工程含义是：S5 的 SLA 必须按&quot;目的国 × 申报模式 × 豁免资格&quot;分桶统计</strong>，把&quot;清关慢&quot;笼统归因会让团队去优化一个政策变量而非流程变量。</p>\n<p>时效口径有两个必须固化的约定：一是<strong>用事件时间（occurred_at）而非处理时间（processed_at）</strong>，否则批量补录会制造虚假的时效尖峰；二是<strong>相对时间统一到 UTC 存储、按目的国时区展示</strong>，跨境订单跨日跨时区，用本地日切会算错&quot;当日妥投率&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"团长效果分析\">团长效果分析</h2><p>团长是拼团的可变获客成本（variable CAC），效果分析要回答&quot;这个团长带来的增量生意是否覆盖了他的佣金&quot;。核心指标是<strong>团长 ROI</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROI</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mtext>attr</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mtext>GMV</mtext><mi>o</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>Cost</mtext><mtext>履约+支付</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mtext>Commission</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>Cost</mtext><mtext>权益</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI}(l) = \\frac{\\sum_{o \\in O_{\\text{attr}}(l)} \\text{GMV}_o\\,(1-\\rho_o) - \\text{Cost}_{\\text{履约+支付}}}{\\text{Commission}(l) + \\text{Cost}_{\\text{权益}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5507em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6147em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Commission</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">权益</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8647em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">attr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">履约</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">支付</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子是被该团长归因且扣除退款 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后的有效毛利，分母是平台为该团长付出的全部激励。计酬规则与归属判定见<a href=\"../group-leader-virality-fraud-control/leader-role-commission-incentive-model\">团长角色与佣金激励模型</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>归因是最大的口径陷阱。</strong> 团长分享的链接在群里被转发多手，&quot;谁该拿功劳&quot;必须靠归因模型回答：末次点击（last-touch）简单但会高估&quot;临门一脚&quot;的团长，多触点（MTA）更公允但难对账。无论选哪种，<strong>归因窗口（attribution window）必须显式配置并固化到订单</strong>，事后改窗口等于改写历史账。更关键的是<strong>增量性（incrementality）</strong>：团长的订单里有多少是本来就会发生的自然流量？正规做法是留一组<strong>对照 holdout</strong>——按用户或社区随机分桶，对照桶不给团长激励，两桶的 GMV 差才是团长真实贡献。没有 holdout 的 ROI 报表只是相关性，不是因果。</p>\n<p>团长分层与防作弊要一起看：如果只看 ROI，会奖励&quot;薅自然流量&quot;的团长、惩罚真在做冷启动拉新的团长。健康的分层应同时看<strong>独立引流占比</strong>（新客中团长带来的比例）与<strong>留存质量</strong>（被带进来的用户 D7/D30 复购）。刷单、自买、机器人拉人会让这些指标异常，欺诈识别机制见<a href=\"../group-leader-virality-fraud-control/invite-virality-growth-mechanism\">邀请裂变与风控</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选品效果分析\">选品效果分析</h2><p>选品决定成团率的上限，度量团品要在<strong>成团能力</strong>与<strong>盈利能力</strong>两个轴上同时定位，形成四象限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>成团率高 + 毛利高</th>\n<th>成团率高 + 毛利低</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>特征</td>\n<td>主推款，加大流量</td>\n<td>引流款，控成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>象限</td>\n<td>成团率低 + 毛利高</td>\n<td>成团率低 + 毛利低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征</td>\n<td>提转化（降门槛/改阶梯）</td>\n<td>淘汰候选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>团品的核心指标组：<strong>成团速度</strong>（发起→达阈中位时长，越短越易传播）、<strong>阶梯触发率</strong>（实际成团档位相对最低档的抬升比例，反映阶梯价设计是否有效）、<strong>退货率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 与<strong>动销率</strong>。阶梯价与库存预占是选品可卖性的工程前提，其建模见<a href=\"../group-formation-engine-inventory-pricing/ladder-pricing-inventory-reservation\">阶梯定价与库存预占</a>。</p>\n<p>选品指标要警惕<strong>幸存者偏差与季节混叠</strong>：只统计&quot;上架一周内成过团&quot;的品，会漏掉慢慢起量后被下架的品；跨季节比较成团率而不做同品类同周对齐，会把大盘波动误判为选品质量变化。正确做法是用<strong>同品类、同周次</strong>的对照口径，并保留被淘汰品的历史指标。跨境的团品还要单独看<strong>合规风险</strong>（GPSR 责任人、CE/FCC 认证、目的国禁限运），一个高成团率但清关卡住的品是负资产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据管道与口径治理\">数据管道与口径治理</h2><p>四层度量最终要落进一份可对账的数据资产，三个工程约定决定了它是否可信：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>口径固化与版本化。</strong> 每个指标定义（分子、分母、过滤条件、时间窗口）作为可版本化对象登记，报表带上口径版本号。改口径必须留版本并回填标注，否则&quot;上个季度的成团率&quot;会变成一个失忆的数字。</li>\n<li><strong>事件时间优先 + 幂等去重。</strong> 拼团事件（发起、加入、支付、退款、清关中、妥投）来自多个上游，重复投递与乱序是常态。落库按业务主键幂等，指标按 <code>occurred_at</code> 分区，重跑可复现。</li>\n<li><strong>口径一致性与对账。</strong> 交易侧&quot;成团数&quot;、履约侧&quot;发货数&quot;、财务侧&quot;结算数&quot;必须能对齐到同一订单集合。这三本账对不上的时间通常出现在跨境——因为清关是异步的，订单在三本账之间的状态转换时点不同。解决办法是维护一个<strong>订单状态主时间线</strong>，三本账都从中派生，而不是各自统计。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>看板与告警：成团率的告警要看<strong>分位与趋势</strong>而非绝对值（周一与周末的基线不同）；履约告警要按 S5 分段，因为清关滞留会在数小时内从 0 冲到两位数占比，且往往由政策而非流程引发。<strong>把政策变量与流程变量分开告警</strong>，才能让值班的人知道该找关务还是找仓库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>拼团运营度量的全部纪律可以压成四条：分母要干净（有效发起）、归因要固化（窗口版本化 + holdout 验增量）、时效要分段（七段串联，清关单独看）、口径要版本化（三本账对齐到一条订单时间线）。跨境的增量复杂度几乎全部落在 S5 清关段与归因窗口上，把这两处单独建模，国内那套成团率与团长 ROI 报表才能安全地跨境复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拼团运营度量：成团率、履约时效与团长/选品效果分析","id":"拼团运营度量-成团率-履约时效与团长-选品效果分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四层度量与北极星","id":"核心概念-四层度量与北极星"},{"level":2,"text":"成团率与失败归因","id":"成团率与失败归因"},{"level":2,"text":"履约时效：跨境分段 SLA","id":"履约时效-跨境分段-sla"},{"level":2,"text":"团长效果分析","id":"团长效果分析"},{"level":2,"text":"选品效果分析","id":"选品效果分析"},{"level":2,"text":"数据管道与口径治理","id":"数据管道与口径治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拼团履约异常：部分到货、跨境退货与成团后售后责任划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-group-buying-team-purchase-commerce-engineering/crossborder-group-fulfillment-ops/group-fulfillment-exception-refund-returns"},"next":null}